+/*  MODIFIED BY THE Ultrahand-4IFIR PROJECT
+ *  ----------------------------------------
+ *  This file is not the upstream original. Changes are marked in place with the
+ *  comment "4IFIR CHANGE" and listed here, as GPL v2 section 2(a) requires.
+ *
+ *  2026-09-01  Sound effects are off by default (the getBool default for the
+ *              "sound_effects" key is now false).
+ *
+ *              This build ships inside another project's firmware, where an overlay
+ *              chirping over a running game is a surprise rather than a feature. The
+ *              key still works exactly as before, and anyone who wants the sounds can
+ *              turn them back on from the Sounds screen; only the starting position
+ *              changed.
+ *
+ *              Two more places carry the same default and are changed to match: the
+ *              static initialiser in libultra/source/tsl_utils.cpp, and the config
+ *              seeding in the overlay's own source. All three must agree -- the
+ *              seeding one writes the key out on first run, so leaving it alone would
+ *              make this default hold for a single launch and then be overwritten.
+ *
+ *  Source of this build: https://github.com/qret/Ultrahand-Overlay, branch 4ifir.
+ */
